    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-08: all `re_path()` routes labeled `[GET]` regardless of view class HTTP method definitions. UAT verified on pretix: `InitializeView`, `UpdateView`, `RollKeyView`, `RevokeKeyView` are POST-only but reported GET. The Django route extractor does not inspect view class method definitions (`def post(self, request):`). Fix: resolve view class symbol and read its declared HTTP method handlers."  # b9cd
